OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners question hospital's   
OL,4,AA&E staffing plans                     
OL,6,FCampaigners who called for the return  
OL,7,Fof a hospital's 24-hour accident and   
OL,8,Femergency unit for a decade are        
OL,9,Fdemanding proof that new plans to make 
OL,10,Fit happen are safe and will not        
OL,11,Fundermine other health services.       
OL,13,FThe A&E unit at Chorley and South      
OL,14,FRibble Hospital in Lancashire was      
OL,15,Frequired to operate on reduced hours   
OL,16,Famid concerns about staffing safety and
OL,17,Ffinances. It currently only operates   
OL,18,Fbetween 08:00-20:00.                   
