OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners question hospital's   
OL,4,AA&E staffing plans                     
OL,6,FNHS bosses announced on Thursday it    
OL,7,Fwill return to a round-the clock       
OL,8,Fadults-only operation before the end of
OL,9,Fnext year.                             
OL,11,FBut a protest group said it only wants 
OL,12,Fto see the full-time A&E service       
OL,13,Freinstated if it can be done so safely 
OL,14,Fand claimed the NHS had done nothing to
OL,15,Fdemonstrate that was the case.         
